      "writtenOn": "2017-10-18T23:29:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Basically, it depends on which one we want to prioritize:\n1. Do we want to assume that RO will have setup always_report mask and just use that?\n2. Assume that we will have to setup always_report mask because RO does not support it yet.\n\nI think a better strategy here would be to uprev LPC_SYSJUMP_VERSION. That way RW can check:\n1. LPC_SYSJUMP_VERSION \u003d\u003d 1 \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003e Re-program the always_report mask since RO EC does not know about it.\n2. LPC_SYSJUMP_VERSION \u003d\u003d 2 \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003e Skip re-programming the always_report mask since RO has already set it up.\n\nDoes this make sense?",
